mapWrapper\nobject, causing duplicate calls to g_signal_connect. If Firefox is running\nlong enough, duplicate handlers accumulate, and Firefox starts to barrage the\nX server with XkbGetUpdatedMap/XkbGetControls calls, slowing the X server and\nitself down.\n\nA symptom of this problem is that after switching the input methods, Firefox\nignores the input for a while (up to several seconds).\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D98847", "files": ["widget/gtk/nsGtkKeyUtils.cpp", "widget/gtk/nsGtkKeyUtils.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "bf5d31bf1b8a84f5f99d55e169193417b4c43a1e", "parents": ["b12df3a6f00f8e996dc5f831eb765d7e287c96f7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1680906 - Update Baidu search engine logo. r=mkaply, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D100398", "files": ["browser/components/search/extensions/baidu/favicon.ico"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "34765f62d7d88b208ee0d231eda4b0a811cf39aa", "parents": ["bf5d31bf1b8a84f5f99d55e169193417b4c43a1e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1685310 - Update Top Sites icons for new version of Baidu logo. r=dao, a=RyanVM\n\nUse a non-transparent version for the search engine favicon.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D100937", "files": ["browser/components/newtab/data/content/tippytop/favicons/baidu-com.ico", "browser/components/newtab/data/content/tippytop/favicons/baidu-com.png", "browser/components/newtab/data/content/tippytop/images/baidu-com@2x.png", "browser/components/newtab/data/content/tippytop/top_sites.json", "browser/components/search/extensions/baidu/favicon.ico"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6629359693ce4bedf533739727f66a15ab24884d", "parents": ["34765f62d7d88b208ee0d231eda4b0a811cf39aa"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Brendan Dahl \u003cbdahl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1683940 - Don't follow redirects on range requests for PDFs. r=robwu, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D100708", "files": ["browser/extensions/pdfjs/content/PdfJsNetwork.jsm"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fe1c27998c737621ad083337a2f573a7f8de10b8", "parents": ["6629359693ce4bedf533739727f66a15ab24884d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nils Ohlmeier [:drno] \u003cdrno@ohlmeier.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1677590: improved SDP parser error handling. r=ng, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D98287", "files": ["media/webrtc/signaling/src/sdp/sipcc/sdp_attr.c"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "925d02e4589cee6ae803c25124383e44337c27c9", "parents": ["fe1c27998c737621ad083337a2f573a7f8de10b8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1610672739, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "173": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1685925 - Only tryAttachTypedArrayLength for specialized stubs. r=iain, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D101344", "files": ["js/src/jit/CacheIR.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0b2a3be4915be03d5434bd445234b7145f4d7dab", "parents": ["925d02e4589cee6ae803c25124383e44337c27c9"], "tags": ["FIREFOX_78_7_0esr_BUILD1"]}], "date": 1610738856, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "174": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 0b2a3be4915be03d5434bd445234b7145f4d7dab with FIREFOX_78_7_0esr_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c84fc495c2e82ff5bfefe8ad75691473630d5e4d", "parent